{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026luHHWdYeZC1795412875.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>大快活中期多賺1.5倍，截至9月底半年，純利約3,300萬元。期內收入升半成，至逾15.9億元，毛利率也升至百分之8.8，擴闊0.7個百分點，帶動經調整EBITDA升兩成一。</p><p></p><p>中期息派一毫半，較去年同期多兩倍。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T06:51:24.649616+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":105,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T05:47:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T10:17:14.420869+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T06:44:50.884299+00:00","content_hash":"590d94935c331a311a1cc0bdfc9f8c9d40b66298dcde77d4134117d6018ecd25","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T06:51:24.649616+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}